            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146740199?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Added a custom ID to the 3d specific CSS properties heading to fix the issue with auto-generated ID stripping the leading number<br>\nRelated to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3473841197\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/322\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/rari/issues/322/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/322\">mdn/rari#322</a></p>",
