        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF145 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">Idempotency-Key</code> header. The key is sent in requests to indicate that a POST/PATCH is a particular unique command. If the server gets the same request with the same key it ignores it.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is draft.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510231336\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41497\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41497/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41497\">#41497</a></p>",
