        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF145 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Integrity-Policy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrity-Policy</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Integrity-Policy-Report-Only\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrity-Policy-Report-Only</a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984973\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984973</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds adds release note and removes the section in experimental features.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510308431\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41511\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41511/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41511\">#41511</a></p>",
